cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use assay-signals, please cite it as below."
title: "assay-signals"
abstract: >
  A thin, read-only companion to assay that reshapes an `assay --json` run
  into a CSV and a one-screen daily digest. No model, no estimate, no
  orders: it only reshapes numbers assay already produced.
authors:
  - alias: bl888m
url: "https://github.com/bl888m/assay-signals"
license: MIT
